AIEW/AUEC is a mixed-license repository. No single license applies to every file.

1. Reference runtime, gateway, control plane, execution engine, tightly coupled
   modules, official server package, wheel, runtime-coupled tests, and the
   coupled example: AGPL-3.0-only.
2. Schemas, conformance vectors, TCK, SDK, separable protocol bindings,
   independent interoperability examples, and build/verification utilities:
   Apache-2.0.
3. AUEC specification, public technical report, narrative documentation,
   architecture explanations, diagrams, governance, and standardization
   documents: CC BY 4.0.

Canonical texts are in LICENSES/. Exact routing is in LICENSE_MAP.csv and
LICENSING.md. Third-party notices are preserved separately.
